meta {
  name: 2 Add services to provider
  type: http
  seq: 2
}
put {
  url: {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/services/{{providerEmail}}
  body: json
}
body:json {
  [
    {
      "name": "60-minute session",
      "description": "One hour, one-to-one",
      "fee": 65.00,
      "isActive": true,
      "professionName": "Fitness"
    }
  ]
}
docs {
  Ownership-guarded. Body is a **JSON array** of services, not a single object.

  `professionName` is required and must be one of the provider's own Professions
  (`PUT /api/v1/professions/providers/{email}`) — the handler rejects a service naming no
  profession, or one the provider doesn't have, with a failed `Result` (see
  `AddServicesToProviderCommandHandler.MissingProfessionErrorMessage`).
}
